{"ts":"2026-08-08T13:32:23.768Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.2","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"95c138f991f8aa572bfafcce","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.2","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-08T13:32:23.768Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-08T13:32:23.768Z","author":"pi-agent","text":"Resolved 18 CodeRabbit findings on PR 7. Applied 13, declined 5 with recorded reasons. Substantive fixes: shared GateResult + runIfMain in script-launcher.ts (removed the 3-way duplicated array-index dispatch and its dead arrows); realpath-based isMainInvocation comparison (Windows drive-letter casing); SIGKILL escalation with injectable escalationMs in streamProcess; case-insensitive allowlist matching + masked rejection reporting in auditGitIdentities; bounded npx tsc --showConfig (--no-install + 60s timeout); JSON.parse guard restating the refusing-to-guess diagnostic; parseLcov narrowed to an existsSync guard so read errors stay honest; showConfig threaded through runGate and main; Windows shell executable path quoting in prepare-merge-driver; trailing-newline on docstring-gate main output; npm tarball narrowed (files: dist/index.*, dist/series.*) so release scripts no longer publish. Test fixes: imported DEFAULT_SKIP_DIRS (single source of truth), added JSON-guard/showConfig-threading/SIGKILL/maskAddress/runIfMain/docstring-success tests. Coverage 100/100/100 across 8 source files (92 tests pass). Declined 5 trivial test-stub extractions (jscpd ignores test/, inline stubs are locally explicit) and the POSIX-only prepare test (ubuntu-only CI; unique end-to-end coverage of the default installer). Redacted the restated authoring address from pm-rl-zcqf narrative records via pm history-redact (allowlist untouched by design). Mutation-verified each touched gate still fails on a real violation: audit (drop stefan@preu.at -> rejects s***@preu.at exit 1), coverage (uncovered branch -> 99.85/99.12 exit 1), docstring (undocumented export -> exit 1)."}]}],"before_hash":"accc15fd452422272b22ae6561d497e94bdc6f153c19e73ec4976b64853bd803","after_hash":"5971a67bc7f95bb2bd791e24f293771fe2eb4d8ed5b7a0f56be9188253ae836d"}
